{"kind": "mod", "id": 1861, "name": "Stash Management Helper", "slug": "stash-management-helper", "teaser": "Enhances stash management with extra sorting features. This can sort your stash long after the default sorting fails.", "owner_name": "Markosz", "downloads": 23422, "favourites": 40, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.markosz.stashmanagementhelper", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Hideout", "category_id": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:02:00.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-11-30T18:06:19.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-11-30T18:06:19.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "0.2.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h3>Features</h3>\n<h2>Customizable Stash Sorting</h2>\n<p>- Create your own sorting strategy or use enhanced EFT default sorting</p>\n<p>- Automatically fold items to optimize space</p>\n<p>- Merge identical item stacks</p>\n<p>- Smart item rotation for optimal fit</p>\n<p>- Configurable empty rows at the top for item dumping</p>\n<p>- Bottom-up sorting option</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/41615461/425192513-f2339a85-65ef-4e22-9bdc-6d01b43a2270.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..dFRcNwVFEKTxhtveNWyfHMkmD-MsTVXgUngkRugOh4I\" alt=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/41615461/425192513-f2339a85-65ef-4e22-9bdc-6d01b43a2270.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..dFRcNwVFEKTxhtveNWyfHMkmD-MsTVXgUngkRugOh4I\" /></p>\n<h2>Sorting Strategies</h2>\n<p>Configure sorting based on multiple criteria:</p>\n<p>- Container size</p>\n<p>- Item size</p>\n<p>- Item type (with customizable type ordering, kinda broken, very much WIP)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Markosz22/StashManagementHelper/assets/41615461/521ecce7-ceda-45cc-8ab2-7539cb11b550\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Markosz22/StashManagementHelper/assets/41615461/521ecce7-ceda-45cc-8ab2-7539cb11b550\" alt=\"521ecce7-ceda-45cc-8ab2-7539cb11b550\" /></a></p>\n<p>Usage</p>\n<p>1. Configure settings according to your preferences (default settings optimized for maximum space efficiency)</p>\n<p>2. Press the sort button</p>\n<p>3. Global options (1) apply to both default and custom sorting methods</p>\n<p>Custom Configuration</p>\n<p>After first use, a <code>customSortConfig.json</code> file will be generated alongside the DLL. This file allows you to:</p>\n<p>- Modify <code>sortOrder</code> to prioritize different sorting criteria</p>\n<p>- Customize <code>itemTypeOrder</code> to define the sequence of item types when using type-based sorting</p>\n<h3>Recommended mods for maximum stash QOL and compatibility notes:</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1769-stash-search/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Stash Search by Dirtbikercj</a>. DO NOT SORT in filtered view (while searching), items can mess up and need restart to see again.<br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1152-inventory-organizing-features/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Inventory Organizing Features by Nightingale</a> originally. Waiting for updated version by someone. Fully compatible.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "0.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 444, "published_at": "2024-11-30T18:06:19.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1861/stash-management-helper/0.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.1.5", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 504, "published_at": "2025-03-18T17:05:55.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1861/stash-management-helper/0.1.5", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.1.8", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5106, "published_at": "2025-04-08T17:13:49.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1861/stash-management-helper/0.1.8", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 24169, "downloads": 724, "published_at": "2025-12-02T10:54:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1861/stash-management-helper/0.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.2.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 23829, "downloads": 10668, "published_at": "2025-12-06T16:09:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1861/stash-management-helper/0.2.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/Markosz22/StashManagementHelper", "label": ""}]}